    {
      "id": "legacy_strings_validate_but_are_unsafe",
      "issue_example": 6,
      "description": "Legacy aggregation strings and contract_version 1.0 and 1.1 definitions keep validating. Without aggregation_semantics they are unsafe for generic aggregation, as is an opaque metric. The legacy label MUST agree with the semantics when both are present.",
      "cases": [
        {
